WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.520
<b>As autumn came around,</b>

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:06.690
<b>peace had returned to Central Flonyard</b>

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.610
<b>after we avoided a small crisis.</b>

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.740
<b>The demon in the Dragons' Forest was successfully defeated</b>

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:19.370
<b>with the combined efforts of the
Tripartite Alliance and their Heroes.</b>

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.700
<b>With the Dragons' Forest safe and sound,</b>

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:27.790
<b>Shinku, our hero, has returned to Biscotti once again!</b>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.420
<b>Nanami, Galette's hero,</b>

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.300
<b>has returned with their army.</b>

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.880
<b>Leo-sama, Lord Gaul, and everyone else seems relieved</b>

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.800
<b>that their hero had returned in one piece.</b>

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:44.810
<b>Pastillage's military flew home.</b>

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.940
<b>Both Cou-sama and Rebecca-san were glad</b>

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:50.060
<b>that neither they nor their friends were in danger anymore.</b>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.150
<b>I've heard that they have plenty of fun activities planned!</b>

