00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.310
<b>Princess?</b>

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:56.440
<b>Good morning, Princess!</b>

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.690
<b>It's time for our morning walk!</b>

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.610
<b>Princess?</b>

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:20.010
<b>I'm ready to go anytime!</b>

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.340
<b>You surprised me, Princess!</b>

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.090
<b>Sorry.</b>

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:28.560
<b>I was so excited that I woke up early!</b>

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.480
<b>All right! Let's go on our walk!</b>

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.480
<b>Yes!</b>

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.270
<b>Where is Nanami?</b>

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:41.030
<b>She is already in there, Milady.</b>

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:45.200
<b>She is prepared to give you a massage.</b>

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.120
<b>Great!</b>

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.360
<b>Is this it?</b>

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:18.900
<b>Yes!</b>

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.270
<b>It's amazing!</b>

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:22.860
<b>It's my newly found walking spot!</b>

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.280
<b>All right then, shall we?</b>

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.490
<b>Yes!</b>

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.580
<b>It's so warm...</b>

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.380
<b>And the smell is exquisite!</b>

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.300
<b>It's called "Rose Daydream."</b>

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.880
<b>It's one of the most popular massage oils in London.</b>

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.720
<b>Your shoulders...</b>

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:50.510
<b>don't seem too stiff.</b>

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.140
<b>But it feels so good!</b>

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:57.560
<b>Your legs and hips seem pretty tense, though.</b>

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.650
<b>It's because we were fighting that demon all day.</b>

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:04.320
<b>I couldn't believe how quickly you arrived from Galette.</b>

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.780
<b>Thanks, Leo-sama!</b>

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:09.490
<b>Hey, it wasn't just me.</b>

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:13.290
<b>I'm just glad that you, Shinku, and the forest were all okay in the end.</b>

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:18.790
<b>You said you have a public broadcast to do later, right?</b>

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:24.960
<b>Yes, about the incident at the Dragons' Forest.</b>

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:29.180
<b>The civilians are surely concerned about this large-scale military operation.</b>

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:36.730
<b>I have the duty to inform them of its motivations and results.</b>

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.690
<b>Being a lord must be tough!</b>

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:42.940
<b>Well, not everybody takes it that seriously.</b>

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:47.400
<b>Our battles make for some excellent stories for most people,</b>

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:53.120
<b>so it's good to tell them about everything we do.</b>

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.200
<b>I see.</b>

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:59.710
<b>Well, I'll have to make sure your 
skin and hair sparkle for the camera!</b>

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.000
<b>Yes!</b>

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.550
<b>Nice catch!</b>

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.000
<b>I caught it!</b>

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.630
<b>That was amazing, Princess!</b>

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.840
<b>Let's keep going!</b>

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.760
<b>Sure! As long as you want!</b>

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:54.800
<b>Something tells me our hero
 is being rude to our princess again.</b>

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:58.390
<b>Oh, I'm sure they're just having lots of fun!</b>

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.850
<b>I can't wait to play with him!</b>

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:05.940
<b>You must be next once he comes back.</b>

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.900
<b>I am!</b>

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.030
<b>The broadcast is gonna be you and...</b>

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.410
<b>who else?</b>

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.700
<b>Violette will represent us.</b>

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:20.790
<b>We'll have a few reps from the 
armies of Biscotti and Pastillage as well.</b>

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.500
<b>I see.</b>

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:32.050
<b>Oh yeah, I hadn't thanked
Adele-sama for making my Spirit Stone.</b>

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.550
<b>Ah, right.</b>

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:38.510
<b>We had already left the forest when she arrived.</b>

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:41.100
<b>Why don't you go visit her today?</b>

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.060
<b>You sure?</b>

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:47.270
<b>If I remember correctly, Génoise has some business in Pastillage today.</b>

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:49.320
<b>You should go with them.</b>

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.280
<b>So, Noire, Jaune, Vert,</b>

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.830
<b>take Nanami with you!</b>

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.450
<b>Y-Yes, ma'am!</b>

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:03.710
<b>Your skin is glowing...</b>

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:06.210
<b>You look more beautiful than ever!</b>

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.960
<b>You'll all be getting the same treatment later!</b>

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.470
<b>Yes!</b>

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:26.730
<b>Couvre, the event hall seems awfully crowded today.</b>

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.110
<b>It is!</b>

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:31.110
<b>The trading society is holding a fall showcase</b>

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:36.610
<b>of new equipment they've made for war shows and such.</b>

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:38.200
<b>I see.</b>

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:40.450
<b>Here's your snack!</b>

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:41.990
<b>Excellent!</b>

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.120
<b>What is this?</b>

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:49.710
<b>It's a French cookie called a Florentine.</b>

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.670
<b>This "France" place, it's a country on Earth, yes?</b>

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:54.840
<b>Wasn't that—</b>

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.970
<b>Thank you, Rebecca.</b>

00:08:56.970 --> 00:09:02.350
<b>I don't remember seeing these cute pastries back when I was there.</b>

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:06.980
<b>It still reminds me of home, though.</b>

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:15.280
<b>I wouldn't have been able to eat this nostalgic food without my adorable descendant and hero.</b>

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.860
<b>I could bring more, if you'd like.</b>

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:19.450
<b>Yes!</b>

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:26.370
<b>As a new hero, there's a lot that 
I'd like to learn from the first generation!</b>

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.370
<b>Oh?</b>

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:33.210
<b>You were the first hero in modern Flonyard,
 even dubbed the "King of Heroes" after saving the world...</b>

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.920
<b>Nobody could ever top that!</b>

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.840
<b>Oh my, please!</b>

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:40.390
<b>You are the pride of my country!</b>

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:43.390
<b>Please, you're exaggerating!</b>

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:49.400
<b>All we did was help the continent get back on its feet.</b>

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:56.280
<b>After all, <i>she</i> was the one who gave me the title and glory of the "King of Heroes."</b>

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:59.320
<b>Excuse me, miladies.</b>

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.780
<b>Oh, Callaway!</b>

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:04.160
<b>Nanami-sama is coming to visit from Galette.</b>

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.040
<b>Oh, really?</b>

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:09.040
<b>She'd like to thank you, Adele-sama, 
for your favor during the incident at the forest.</b>

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.040
<b>Where is she now?</b>

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.590
<b>Well...</b>

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.220
<b>Hey, Adele-sama, Cou-sama!</b>

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:21.050
<b>We're here!</b>

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.010
<b>They're right there.</b>

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.680
<b>Grandmother!</b>

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.180
<b>Go ahead.</b>

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:27.770
<b>Let them in.</b>

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:31.770
<b>Adele-sama.</b>

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:35.650
<b>Thank you very much for making the Spirit Stone for me!</b>

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.070
<b>It was my pleasure.</b>

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.900
<b>I'm glad that you put it to good use.</b>

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:42.910
<b>This stone lets you borrow power from the spirits...</b>

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:49.660
<b>Just like the stone that my loved one had.</b>

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:54.000
<b>She was the last ruler of the Kingdom of Pastillage,</b>

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.300
<b>the princess who summoned me here...</b>

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:02.300
<b>I remembered her Spirit Stone and tried to replicate it.</b>

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:06.180
<b>I'm sure you looked beautiful after your transformation.</b>

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.310
<b>Yes!</b>

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.310
<b>I got taller, and my hair changed color too!</b>

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:13.060
<b>My Hero Stones went to Gaul and Shinku.</b>

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.810
<b>Valery's Demon Stone to Rebecca,</b>

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:19.320
<b>and the Spirit Stone, to you.</b>

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:23.450
<b>I've heard the tale of the first hero.</b>

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:30.910
<b>The princess, hero, and demon lord fought 
together to defeat a demon and save the world!</b>

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:34.830
<b>Everyone in the world knows that tale!</b>

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:36.380
<b>Really?</b>

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:40.210
<b>Heroes used to do such things in old times.</b>

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:44.510
<b>The world is much more peaceful today,</b>

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:47.970
<b>but a hero always has one job:</b>

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:52.730
<b>To bring a smile to everyone's face.</b>

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.060
<b>To do that, I'll need your—</b>

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:09.490
<b>Well, well! To what do I owe the pleasure?!</b>

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:09.990
<b>Huh?</b>

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.500
<b>Isn't that...</b>

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:19.670
<b>These odd, squishy creatures jumped onto us, and...</b>

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:20.630
<b>Squishy?</b>

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.010
<b>This way, everyone!</b>

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.190
<b>Valery!</b>

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.570
<b>A-Adele!</b>

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.070
<b>What is <i>that?</i></b>

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.110
<b>Eek!</b>

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:43.820
<b>I knew it...</b>

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.160
<b>You were cultivating Squishy-Squashies!</b>

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.450
<b>Squishy-Squashies?</b>

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:50.990
<b>Squishy-Squashies are demons
that multiply and attack people.</b>

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:52.790
<b>They're quite dangerous.</b>

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:53.580
<b>What?!</b>

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:55.290
<b>Hold on, Adele!</b>

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.080
<b>You're giving them biased information!</b>

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.590
<b>Would you care to give me an <i>un</i>biased description?</b>

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:08.050
<b>Th-They've never hurt anyone!</b>

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:10.550
<b>They just eat cloth and metal!</b>

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:12.430
<b>Cloth and metal?</b>

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:13.270
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:16.940
<b>Especially things that have sweat and stuff on them.</b>

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.560
<b>So then...</b>

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.560
<b>Back when I was the demon lord,</b>

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:23.820
<b>I put them at the entrance to my labyrinth.</b>

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.110
<b>They're pretty darn useful.</b>

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:33.200
<b>They eat all the clothes and equipment of all the brave adventurers,</b>

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.410
<b>and make them give up on their quest altogether.</b>

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:40.330
<b>Sure, that's a good trap, but...</b>

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:47.050
<b>You promised me that you'd seal them in a 
magical box because you had no use for them anymore.</b>

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.590
<b>W-Well...</b>

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:52.640
<b>Liscia and her stupid gang have been busting me all the time, so I, uh...</b>

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:55.720
<b>wanted to get back at 'em, ya know?</b>

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.400
<b>Ridiculous.</b>

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.360
<b>Absolutely disgraceful!</b>

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.530
<b>Armor and clothes...</b>

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.740
<b>They might be headed for the knights' quarters.</b>

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.610
<b>The event hall!</b>

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:13.160
<b>Those are models in the hall, not knights!</b>

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.120
<b>They can't fight back!</b>

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.160
<b>Let's go!</b>

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:18.870
<b>Yes!</b>

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.370
<b>Knights here!</b>

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:22.500
<b>We've encountered the demons in our quarters,</b>

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:26.460
<b>and they've all been captured.</b>

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:27.760
<b>Excellent job, Liscia.</b>

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:30.510
<b>We'll head to the event hall!</b>

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:36.640
<b>No!</b>

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:39.810
<b>Look over there!</b>

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:45.070
<b>They're multiplying!</b>

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:46.780
<b>And super fast, at that!</b>

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.400
<b>If they got out into the city...</b>

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.160
<b>That'd be trouble!</b>

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:54.370
<b>We have to stop them!</b>

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.620
<b>Let's go, girls!</b>

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:56.990
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.910
<b>Let's go.</b>

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.250
<b>Yes!</b>

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.840
<b>Can't you control them, Valery?</b>

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:09.050
<b>I could try, but...</b>

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:12.260
<b>I think they're too dumb to listen.</b>

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.720
<b>Eek!</b>

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:17.220
<b>We can't leave our problems in the hands of others.</b>

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:19.640
<b>You <i>will</i> solve this as quickly as possible!</b>

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:20.640
<b>Yes, ma'am...</b>

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:35.910
<b>No way!</b>

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:56.140
<b>No!</b>

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:05.770
<b>There's too many...</b>

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.480
<b>Oh my god!</b>

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:25.000
<b>Seven Tails!</b>

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:50.730
<b>Oh no!</b>

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:56.490
<b>They got me...</b>

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.000
<b>I can't stop them!</b>

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:08.250
<b>Boo hoo...</b>

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.090
<b>They got Génoise?!</b>

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.340
<b>Cou-sama stopped firing as well!</b>

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.970
<b>They're multiplying too quickly.</b>

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.090
<b>At this rate...</b>

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:34.860
<b>Oh man, this ain't good...</b>

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.490
<b>Valery!</b>

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.530
<b>Don't just stand there!</b>

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:50.330
<b>I see...</b>

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:52.250
<b>Yes!</b>

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:56.670
<b>With the powers of a spirit, demon, and hero combined,</b>

00:17:56.670 --> 00:18:00.300
<b>we may be able to solve this!</b>

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.430
<b>Rebecca, Nanami,</b>

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:04.680
<b>I need your help!</b>

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:11.810
<b>Demon Stone...</b>

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:13.440
<b>Spirit Stone...</b>

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.440
<b>Activate!</b>

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.440
<b>Activate!</b>

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:55.440
<b>Demon Seal!</b>

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:00.990
<b>Spirit Barrier!</b>

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.380
<b>Hero Stone!</b>

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:31.270
<b>Shine bright, ray of purification!</b>

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:35.860
<b>Go!</b>

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:15.310
<b>Wait, what the...</b>

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:19.820
<b>They turned a demon into a spirit just like that!</b>

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.080
<b>I've never seen anyone 'cept my sis do that...</b>

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:42.840
<b>And so the showcase was resumed, ending later than scheduled.</b>

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:46.590
<b>Nobody was hurt, and there was less damage to the building than we had thought.</b>

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:51.140
<b>But Callaway-san seemed to be buried in the paperwork,</b>

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.350
<b>so I think I'll bring him a snack later.</b>

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:58.610
<b>I'm sorry to have put you all through this.</b>

00:20:58.610 --> 00:20:59.940
<b>It's all right.</b>

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:02.570
<b>I'm sorry couldn't help more...</b>

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.240
<b>We were useless.</b>

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.530
<b>No, you did well!</b>

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:11.370
<b>I think I did something cool, but I don't remember...</b>

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.750
<b>You'll understand soon enough.</b>

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:17.500
<b>This is thanks to the Spirit Stone and Demon Stone, huh?</b>

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:18.250
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.380
<b>It was quite the incident,</b>

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:28.260
<b>but this was achievable only because the three powers of the spirit, demon, and hero came together.</b>

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:32.890
<b>It reminds me a bit of the old days.</b>

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:37.690
<b>Oh yeah, where's Valery-san?</b>

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:38.520
<b>Oh,</b>

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:40.650
<b>I haven't seen him since earlier this evening.</b>

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:48.950
<b>Adele...</b>

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:51.030
<b>Hey, Adele!</b>

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.030
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:53.240
<b>I really am!</b>

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:55.410
<b>Please! Lemme go!</b>

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.960
<b>A bad boy deserves a time out!</b>

